      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "# EADS — AnyLog Network Query Dashboard\n\nAll panels query through the **AnyLog Query Node** (`destination: network`), which distributes queries across all operator nodes automatically.\n\n**Filter** — Use the `filter` variable above to add WHERE conditions (e.g. `sensor_id = 'S1'` or `location = 'Zone5'`). Leave blank for all data.\n\nTime-series panels use AnyLog's optimized **increments** function. KPIs use SQL passthrough over the last hour.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "simpod-json-datasource", "uid": "anylog-query" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "avg_voltage" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "Avg Voltage (1h)" },
              { "id": "unit", "value": "volt" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "avg_current" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "Avg Current (1h)" },
              { "id": "unit", "value": "amp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "avg_power" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "Avg Power (1h)" },
              { "id": "unit", "value": "kwatt" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "avg_frequency" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "Avg Frequency (1h)" },
              { "id": "unit", "value": "hertz" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "anomaly_rate" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "Anomaly Rate (1h)" },
              { "id": "unit", "value": "percent" },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "green", "value": null },
                    { "color": "orange", "value": 5 },
                    { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 50,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "simpod-json-datasource", "uid": "anylog-query" },
          "refId": "A",
          "target": "grid_readings",
          "type": "table",
          "payload": "{\"dbms\": \"eads\", \"type\": \"sql\", \"sql\": \"SELECT AVG(voltage) AS avg_voltage, AVG(current) AS avg_current, AVG(power) AS avg_power, AVG(frequency) AS avg_frequency, 100.0 * AVG(CASE WHEN anomaly_label <> 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS anomaly_rate FROM grid_readings WHERE timestamp >= NOW() - 1 hour\", \"where\": \"${filter}\", \"time_range\": false}"
        }
      ],
      "title": "KPI Summary (last hour)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
